    - target: {fileID: 2298647161643049540, guid: 0222a1b4f9c504f4cb194ba535c119ea, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "That\u2019s Correct!\r\n\r\nIdentify the condition - The student selected
        is a girl, so only girls are considered.\r\n\r\nFind the number of girls\r\n\r\nGirls
        = 8\r\n\r\nFind the number of girls who wear glasses\r\n\r\nGirls wearing
        glasses = 5\r\n\r\nUse the conditional probability formula\r\n\r\nP(\\text{Glasses}
        \\mid \\text{Girl}) =\r\n\\frac{\\text{Number of girls wearing glasses}}{\\text{Number
        of girls}}\r\n\r\nSubstitute the values\r\n\r\nP(\\text{Glasses} \\mid \\text{Girl})
        = \\frac{5}{8}\r\n\r\nFinal answer\r\n\r\nP(\\text{Glasses} \\mid \\text{Girl})
        = \\frac{5}{8}\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
